  "title": "Jubilant Roasted Indian Eggplant Baingan Bharta",
  "description": "A roasted, shaggy, festive Indian dish featuring rice krispies, confit-tomato, and ayurvedic-rajasic-friendly ingredients, served in a lotus leaf wrap.",
